From 461d103cacea583ff731a082488e0f26d16801f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jason Smith <jsmith@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 29 May 2025 09:13:44 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-230673] pdr: deprecate utf16 aux names

All firmwares have been migrated to use ASCII aux names.
Support for UTF16 can be deprecated and removed.

Change-Id: I0f5483cb918690e8be733913377626e96947f168
Signed-off-by: Jason Smith <jsmith@habana.ai>
---

diff --git a/include/pldm_base.h b/include/pldm_base.h
index 9c14ffd..e8e4641 100644
--- a/include/pldm_base.h
+++ b/include/pldm_base.h
@@ -1511,14 +1511,7 @@
